  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Advanced Capacities for Trade project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Advanced Capacities for Trade project has been uniquely designed to contribute to a host of complex and inter-linked goals, aiming at supporting an environment of trust and cooperation across the post-conflict divide through capitalizing on the opportunities offered by the Deep and Comprehensive Free Trade Area and SPTCA, while consolidating trade ties across the river and with the European Union, and supporting economic growth that benefits the most vulnerable. The project represents a framework for engaging in development interventions on both sides of the Nistru River, primarily focusing at improving the livelihoods of the people from both sides of the Nistru River through their mutual cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
